<section class="panel radio-page">
    <h2>Out of Bounds Radio</h2>
    <p>Your Gaming Radio Station — run by the old <strong>Everlook Broadcasting Co.</strong> team. Streaming live, 24/7, straight from the <a href="https://www.outofbounds.live/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Out of Bounds Ent.</a> transmitter. Tune in with the direct stream link below.</p>
</section>

<section class="panel">
    <h2>The Signal's Story</h2>
    <p>This station is the loudest survivor in the private-server scene. What started as an in-game radio inside <a href="/servers/turtle-wow/">Turtle WoW</a> — tuned with a button on the minimap — grew into a full community operation: DJs like <strong>Zappo Zapblast</strong>, the live show <em>Living in the Past</em>, voice-acted skits and RP ads, plus a <em>WoW Radio</em> app on Google Play and a YouTube channel.</p>
    <p>When Turtle WoW shut down on <a href="/news/turtle-wow-shutdown/">May 15, 2026</a> after Blizzard's cease-and-desist, the broadcasting team kept the signal alive. It rebranded as <strong>Out of Bounds Entertainment</strong> — "Your Gaming Radio Station. From the old Everlook Broadcasting Co. team" — and has been streaming around the clock ever since. The in-game minimap tuner died with the server; the station itself did not.</p>
    <p class="meta-info">Cross-reference: <a href="/news/turtle-wow-shutdown/">Turtle WoW shutdown news</a> · <a href="/news/blizzard-v-turtle-wow-consent-judgment/">Blizzard v. Turtle WoW</a></p>
</section>

